# Agent workbench — local scratch only. One-off task scripts and generated
# artifacts live here so they never reach the repository root, and they are not
# source: they are the residue of a task, not its result. The README is the one
# tracked file, because the rules have to survive the cleanup.
ai/workbench/scripts/
ai/workbench/artifacts/
!ai/workbench/README.md

# Impeccable (advisory design tool; GAME_NEW_SYSTEM_ROADMAP.md stays authoritative).
# The skill copies (and their ~17 MB engine binaries) are per-developer installs,
# like node_modules: `npx impeccable install --scope=project`. Only the project
# configuration (.impeccable/config.json, hooks, agents) is shared.
.claude/skills/impeccable/
.agents/skills/impeccable/
.opencode/skills/impeccable/
.gemini/skills/impeccable/
.agent/skills/impeccable/

# impeccable-ignore-start
# Ephemeral output, runtime state, and per-dev overrides.
# The **/ prefix covers .impeccable at the repo root or in a nested workspace.
# Shared artifacts stay tracked: config.json, live/config.json,
# design.json, surfaces/*.md, critique/*.md.
**/.impeccable/config.local.json
**/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
**/.impeccable/hook.pending.json
**/.impeccable/*.png
**/.impeccable/review/
**/.impeccable/questions/
**/.impeccable/live/server.json
**/.impeccable/live/sessions/
**/.impeccable/live/previews/
**/.impeccable/live/annotations/
**/.impeccable/live/cache/
**/.impeccable/live/manual-edit-apply-transaction.json
**/.impeccable/live/manual-edit-events.jsonl
**/.impeccable/live/manual-edit-evidence/
**/.impeccable/live/pending-manual-edits.json
**/.impeccable/live/deferred-svelte-component-accepts.json
**/.impeccable/live/*.png
# impeccable-ignore-end
